  "description": "**Taiwan Weather Radar (QPESUMS)**\n\nMaximum reflectivity (MaxDBZ) composites from the Taiwan weather radar network.\n\n- **Spatial**: Taiwan Region (20\u00b0N-27\u00b0N, 118\u00b0E-123.5\u00b0E)\n- **Temporal**: 10-minute intervals (2013-2023)\n- **Variable**: MaxDBZ (Radar Reflectivity)\n\nIdeal for mesoscale convective system analysis and precipitation monitoring.\n",
